  "description": "Unleash the power of the Juggernaut FS Step-Thru, Biktrix’s latest masterpiece in electric mountain biking. Designed with the seasoned rider in mind, this Full Suspension, Low Step eMTB combines power, endurance, and comfort for an unparalleled riding experience.\nKey Features:\n\nPowerful Performance: Equipped with a 1500W 52V 30A Custom Bafang Ultra M620 Mid-drive Motor and boasting 200Nm+ of peak torque, conquer challenging hills with ease.\n\nLong-lasting Endurance: A massive 52V 25Ah 1300Wh downtube battery ensures extended riding sessions, easily removable for hassle-free recharging.\n\nSmooth Ride: Experience ultimate comfort with full suspension powered by the Rockshox 35 Gold TK and DNM AO-38RC Rear Suspension, offering customizable travel and rebound adjustment.\n\nSafety First: Tektro E725 Quad-Piston Brakes and Adjustable Levers with Integrated Brake Cutoffs ensure powerful stops and customizable control.\n\nSuperior Traction: Dominate any terrain with Boost Spacing Wheelsets, 36H Solid Black Rims, and Maxxis Rekon tires, delivering exceptional grip and durability.\n\nUser-friendly Design: Effortlessly mount and dismount with the low step frame, while on-demand throttle and seamless pedal assistance provide instant power.\n\nCustomizable Comfort: Velo Bolt-On MTB Grips offer optimal control and comfort, with two frame sizes and a variety of color options for a personalized fit.\n\nBenefits:\n\nEffortlessly conquer challenging terrain with powerful motor and peak torque.\n\nEnjoy extended riding sessions with long-lasting battery life.\n\nExperience a smooth and tailored ride with customizable suspension.\n\nRide confidently with powerful brakes and customizable control.\n\nDominate any terrain with superior traction and durability.\n\nEnjoy a user-friendly design for easy mounting and dismounting.\n\nPersonalize your comfort and style with customizable options.",
